@startuml
title PING and Connection Limits - Redis-like Server

actor Client
participant Server

== Normal flow ==
Client -> Server : PING
Server --> Client : +PONG

== Normal flow: PING with a message ==
Client -> Server : PING "message"
Server --> Client : $7 message (a bulk string)

== Alternate flow A1: too many arguments ==
Client -> Server : PING a b
Server --> Client : -ERR wrong number of arguments for 'ping' command

== Alternate flow A2: unknown command ==
Client -> Server : PINGG
Server --> Client : -ERR unknown command 'PINGG', with args beginning with:

== Alternate flow A3: idle client (--idle-timeout) ==
Client -> Server : PING
Server --> Client : +PONG
... nothing sent for --idle-timeout seconds ...
Server -> Client : close the connection (counted in INFO)

== Alternate flow A4: server full (--maxclients) ==
Client -> Server : connect
Server --> Client : -ERR max number of clients reached
Server -> Client : close the connection

@enduml
